杂感六首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"谗口安能作祸基，吾曹兴废岂无时。\n向来何事令公怒，问著渠侬自不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4899,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂感四首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"祸福虽云不可猜，人生要岂愿为才。\n髑髅正使非王乐，牺象何疑是木灾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4900,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂感十首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"百年鼎鼎成何事，寒暑相催即白头。\n纵得金丹真不死，摩挲铜狄更添愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4901,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂感六首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"一尊易致蒲萄酒，万里难逢鹳鹊楼。\n何日群胡遗种尽，关河形胜得重游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4902,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂感六首 其六","author":"陆游","text":"苦热惟忧不复凉，转头忽已见清霜。\n道人若悟无寒暑，堕指流金总道场。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4903,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂感五首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"少年意气与春争，朱弹金鞭处处行。\n谁信即今空谷里，旋租黄犊学躬耕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4904,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂感五首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"自洗铜壶试玉醅，小轩风月为徘徊。\n此心未与年俱老，犹解逢花眼暂开。","collec